# Per-target run artifacts written by fork.sh / vault-service.sh / enter-loop.sh
# (pidfiles, wasm copies, the Priime node home, vault-service.json, logs).
# deploy/.fork/ is also listed in the root .gitignore; every other target's
# state dir is covered here, so adding a target does not need a second edit
# somewhere else.
.fork/
.mainnet/
